## Fix round 1 (F1–F5, TEST_RESULTS Run 1), 2026-11-15, npm run pipeline:v5 from cache (no re-export)
Changes:
- sex.py (F2): new anatomy_field(pose): on the chest (y 1.05–1.45, z > 0.02, male skin), skin where |Dfull − Dlow| > 4 mm,
  grown 2 rings (793 vertices), gets the harmonic fill of Dlow from its border (scipy sparse solve). apply() warps every
  part with it instead of Dlow. Pec forward shift beyond the sternum shift: 12.2 mm → 5.9 mm (the saturated chest box gives
  5.5 mm, so the breast part is gone). Literal F2 check (female pec max z − male) was already −8.0 mm and is now −10.9 mm.
- sex.py (F3): generated parts go through geom.outward() (SPEC step 2). The ellipsoids and tubes were wound inside-out.
- sex.py (F4): breast fat patch (sample's region rule, unchanged) is linearly subdivided until ≥ 400 vertices per side,
  then Taubin-smoothed (trimesh). trimesh 5.2.1 subdivide_loop moves open borders wrongly (a vertex went 0.4 m up), so not used.
  Breast fat: 78/85 → 894/970 vertices.
- names.py + pack.py (F5): names.HIDDEN = omentum|mesocolon|pleura; every manifest part carries "defaultHidden" (true for
  Greater omentum, Lesser omentum, Mesocolon, Pleura). FORMAT.md does not list the field yet (not in this round's files).
- layers.py (F1): unchanged. Self hits are 3% of AO hits within 5 cm; see the F1 measurements in contact-notes.md.

